          "foerderendedatum": {
            "type": [
              "string",
              "null"
            ],
            "format": "date",
            "description": "The EEG Förderende, or `NULL` for a plant that has none.\n\n§ 25 Abs. 1 EEG 2023 dates the EEG claim in years. § 8 KWKG does not: it\nmeasures the Zuschlag in Vollbenutzungsstunden (Abs. 1–3) and caps each\ncalendar year separately (Abs. 4), and both are counters against\ngeneration. A KWK plant therefore has no calendar Förderende and this is\n`NULL` for it — `kwk_max_kwh` is what ends its Zuschlag."
          },
